<title>USA: U.S. stockpile offers 1 million pounds of cobalt.</title>
<headline>U.S. stockpile offers 1 million pounds of cobalt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said it was offering about one million lbs of cobalt for sale under the sealed bid format.</p>
<p>Bids for this material must be received by 1300 EST/1800 GMT Dec 2.</p>
<p>A DLA official said the grade of material ranged from 99.00 to 99.59 percent cobalt.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities 212-859-1646</p>
